---
# Stealth Startup - Infrastructure Deployment & Software Compliance
# Current architecture: GitHub App → Control plane → Ephemeral runners
# Plus GCP layout, AI remediation, planned BYOC
# Reference: architecture.md
---

flowchart TB
  subgraph Customer["Customer"]
    GHOrg[GitHub Organization]
  end

  GHApp[GitHub App Integration]

  subgraph Control["Stealth Startup Control / Orchestration Layer"]
    Prov[CI Runner Provisioning]
    Orch[Workflow & AI-Agent Orchestration]
    RCA[Build-Log Analysis & RCA]
    CacheCtl[Docker & GitHub Actions Caching]
    Scan[Security / Compliance Scanning]
  end

  subgraph AppPlane["Application Plane - GKE"]
    K8s[Kubernetes<br/>Stateful + Stateless Services]
    PG[(PostgreSQL)]
    Vertex[Vertex AI<br/>Open-model workloads]
    GPU[GPU Pipeline<br/>Self-host inference - in progress]
  end

  subgraph Messaging["Messaging"]
    NATS[NATS JetStream<br/>Runners · Capacity · Authenticator<br/>Runner ↔ Service communication]
    PubSub[Pub/Sub<br/>Ad hoc triggers<br/>Add-ons · Log analysis · Debug]
  end

  subgraph Runners["Ephemeral GCP Compute Runners"]
    CE[Compute Engine VMs<br/>C4D · us-central1<br/>Often 32 vCPU / 128 GB<br/>~30 VM types]
    Jobs[Execute GitHub CI Jobs]
    Results[Results & Logs Back]
    CE --> Jobs --> Results
  end

  subgraph Perf["Caching"]
    MicroCeph[MicroCeph<br/>Distributed CI cache<br/>Up to 80% faster CI]
  end

  subgraph Delivery["Platform Delivery"]
    TF[Terraform]
    Helm[Helm]
    Argo[ArgoCD GitOps]
    TF --> Argo
    Helm --> Argo
  end

  subgraph Compliance["SOC 2–Aligned Compliance"]
    PrivNet[Private Networking]
    ZT[Zero Trust]
    IAM[Least-Privilege IAM]
    S2S[Secure Service-to-Service]
  end

  subgraph Obs["Observability"]
    OTel[OpenTelemetry]
    GCM[Google Cloud Monitoring]
    OTel --> GCM
  end

  subgraph AIFlow["AI Failure Remediation"]
    Fail[CI Failure + Logs]
    Sandbox[Sandbox Code Exam]
    Agents[Multi-Agent RCA + Fix]
    PR[PR + Security/Quality Checks]
    Owner[Customer Code Owner Merge Decision]
    Fail --> Sandbox --> Agents --> PR --> Owner
  end

  subgraph BYOC["Planned BYOC"]
    Brain[Platform Control Plane / Brain]
    CustDP[Customer AWS/GCP Data Plane<br/>CI execution · code · sensitive workloads]
    Brain --> CustDP
  end

  GHOrg --> GHApp --> Control
  Control --> CE
  Results --> Control
  Argo --> K8s
  K8s --> PG
  CE <-->|runner capacity auth| NATS
  NATS <-->|community / platform services| K8s
  Control --> PubSub
  PubSub -->|add-ons · log analysis · debug triggers| Control
  Orch --> Vertex
  Orch --> GPU
  MicroCeph --> Jobs
  CacheCtl --> Jobs
  RCA --> AIFlow
  K8s --> OTel
  CE --> GCM
  PrivNet --> K8s
  ZT --> Control
  IAM --> Control
  S2S --> K8s
  Scan --> Compliance

